  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rights and resilience response for crisis affected communities in South Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program is designed to reach vulnerable communities in Pibor and Rumbek with Education, Governance and Peace building, Gender and various forms of humanitarian response including Water Sanitation and Hygiene (WASH), Protection and Emergency Food Security and Vulnerable Livelihood (EFSVL) for a period of 4 years</narrative>
  </description>
